<title>UK: PSK sets 300 bln lire zero-coupon bond.</title>
<headline>PSK sets 300 bln lire zero-coupon bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Banca Nazionale del Lavoro and Cariplo.</p>
<p> BORROWER   OESTERREICHISCHE POSTSPARKASSE (PSK)</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  AUSTRIA</p>
<p> AMT    300 BLN LIRE  COUPON     ZERO	MATURITY   *30.OCT.03</p>
<p> TYPE   ZERO-COUPON   ISS PRICE  58.745    PAY DATE    30.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875 PCT REOFFER    56.97     SPREAD	 =</p>
<p> NOTES	*CALL AT 77.335 ON 30.OCT.00</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (M) 5-50    SALE LIMITS US/UK/IT/AU</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA (2)</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.625     SELL CONC  1.25	PRAECIP     =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
